<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμνίον</span></b>  (not so well <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμνιον</span>), τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bowl in which the blood of victims
				was caught,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.444
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>inner membrane round the foetus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				71
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμνειός.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Dim. of
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμνός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				3
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄμνιος</span> as pr. n. wrongly
				<u>Et.Gen.</u>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
